      ":question/worked-solution": "- $C$ is *not* a column vector, since it has more than $1$ column (it has $2$ columns).\n\n- $B$ is a column vector since it has only one column.\n\n- $A$ is *not* a column vector, since it has more than $1$ column (it has $6$ columns).\n\nTherefore, only $B$ is a column vector.",
